msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "You're kidding! That place is huge! I've seen it on TV!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Isn't that where all the big stars and politicians go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Actually, we've got a patient like that in the VIP room right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Really? Who!?"
msgstr "Davvero? Chi?"

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Well, only the doctor in charge knows his identity, but I imagine he's "
"famous in one way or another. I wonder who it could be..."
msgstr ""

